# Anchor sources for commit-msg. One source per line, whitespace-separated:
#   TYPE   FILES (glob, relative to repo root; '-' = exempt)   LINE-PREFIX
# An anchor resolves if a matching file has a line '<LINE-PREFIX> <ANCHOR>'
# followed by a space or end of line. A TYPE may appear on several lines.
# Paths must not contain spaces. LINE-PREFIX must be literal (no regex).
